<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, now that it's spring, we play soccer outdoors.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How did it happen?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I was sprinting towards the ball, but then I tripped in some mud. I sprawled onto the field with my legs spread out like an eagle.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ouch!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le15ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How are you doing?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm good. I just got an interesting e-mail from a young woman starting a career in journalism. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What did you tell her?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I told her I thought it was a good idea to take some courses and get some freelance experience. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Do you think it is difficult for someone who wants to start working in journalism to break into the field?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It can be tough. In my opinion, it's important to get experience. I told her she could write articles for <span class=\"italic\">Cambridge Life</span>.", "id": 2, "time": "23500", "image": "engenn7le15ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How challenging do you think it is for a new journalist to find stories that appeal to a wide audience?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't think it's very difficult. You have to engage with people and listen to their comments.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She could write about the dangers of running on a soccer field in the spring!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: OK, good idea!", "id": 3, "time": "52500", "image": "engenn7le15ob04re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le15ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le15ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}